
<div id="urduTextPath">امام حسن (ع)/مومنو خانۂ زہرا میں قیامت ہے آج</div>

Momino qaana e zehra me qayamat hai aaj<br>
Betiyou par allah allah ke aafat hai aaj<br>
Gham se taagheer har ek shaqs ki haalat hai aaj<br>
Qalq se shabbar e zeejaah ki rehlat hai aaj<br>
<br>
Dushmane aale nabi ne ye sitam dhaaya hai<br>
Sam e qaatil shahe zeejah ko dilwaaya hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Haal ye sheh ki shahadat ka kutab me hai raqam<br>
Kooze me daal diya jodha e maloona ne sam<br>
Pyaas thi shab ko jo bedaar huwe shaahe umam<br>
Nosh paani kiya us koozeh se sheh ne jisdam<br>
<br>
Ghair ehwaal huwa fatima ke dilbar ka<br>
Muh ko kat kat ke jigar aane laga shabbar ka<br>
____________________________<br>
Di ye zainab ko sada thaam ke hathou se jigar<br>
Phir kisi ne diya sam bhaai ko doud'ho qwahar<br>
Pherta hai koi goya ke jigar par qanjar<br>
Hai ye nazdeek suwe quld ho dunya se safar<br>
<br>
Jald ab taaba e taqdeer ko bulwaao behan<br>
Tukde dil hota hai shabbir ko bulwaao behan<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Qabar e badh kisi bhaai ki na sunwaaye quda<br>
Bhai ke ranj me bhai ko na rulwaaye quda<br>
Tukde bhai ke kaleje ke na dikhlaaye quda<br>
Bhai ke aage na bhai ki ajal aawe quda<br>
<br>
Sunke ehwaal e hassan sadma o gham paaye hai<br>
Bhai se ruqsat e aqir ko hussain aaye hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Kehte hai zabt ka mujhko nahi yaara bhai<br>
Uth gaya qalq se ab chain hamara bhai<br>
Hogaya tukde jigar zehar se saara bhai<br>
Dekhu kis tarha se ye haal tumhara bhai<br>
<br>
Bhai jaa'n bekaso nashaad se muh modhte ho<br>
Sitam aijaadou ke narghe me mujhe chodhte ho<br>
____________________________<br>
Hogaya paani, ye haal jo maloom huwa<br>
Leke shabbir ne us kooze ko peena chaha<br>
Bole bhai se lipat kar hassan e sabz qaba<br>
Bhai ye aapka hissa ye kya ye kya<br>
<br>
Apne waade ko zara dhyaan me laao bhai<br>
Hai pareshaan haram jaa'n naa gawaao bhai<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
Tum pe jo baad, mere hona hai pyaare bhai<br>
Hai mere peshe nazar zulm wo saare bhai<br>
Dil pe chalte hai mere ranj ke aare bhaai<br>
Tashnalab rehna hai darya ke kaanere bhaai<br>
<br>
Bhook me teer o tabar jism pa khana hai tumhe<br>
Aab e shamsheer se pyaas apni bujhaana hai tumhe<br>
<br>
____________________________<br>
Teen din peet'te rone me huwe jab ke basar<br>
Khol kar aankhou ko kehne lage sab se shabbar<br>
Tum se ruqsat hai meri aye harame qair e bashar<br>
Aaye hai quld se lene ko mere paighambar<br>
<br>
Sounpa bhai ko quda ko tumhe unko<br>
Sab meri tarha imaam apna samjhna unko<br>
____________________________<br>
Kehte the ye, huwa zard ruq e paak tamaam<br>
Hichkiya'n aane lagi ho gaye bechain imaam<br>
Padhgaya aale rasool e arabi me kohraam<br>
Kalma padh ke suwe quld gaye shaahe imaam<br>
<br>
Peet kar seena o sar ehle haram rone lage<br>
Muh ko ashkou se hussain ibne ali dhone lage<br>
____________________________<br>
Laash pe gir ke kaha haaye aqi haaye aqi<br>
Sath mujhko na liya haaye aqi haaye aqi<br>
Kar gaye aap qaza haye aqi haye aqi<br>
Chain bhaai ka gaya haye aqi haye aqi<br>
<br>
Dukh me ab koun meri lega qabar bhaai jaa'n<br>
Kargaye chod ke bhai ko safar bhaai jaa'n<br>
____________________________<br>
Qalq me hota hai jaankaah alam bhaai ka<br>
Sadma hota nahi kuch mout se kam bhaai ka<br>
De na qaaliq kisi hamsheer ko gham bhaai ka<br>
Kisi qwahar se bichadna hai sitam bhaai ka<br>
<br>
Bhaai ke daagh ko hamsheer ke dil se pucho<br>
Ranj ye zainab e dilgeer ke dil se pucho<br>
____________________________<br>
Laash par bhaai ki rote the shahinshaahe hudaa<br>
Aaye'n jo itne me waa'n binte janaabe zehra<br>
Ashk aankhou me the riqqat se badan kaanpta tha<br>
Bhaai ke laash pe chaadar ko udha kar ye kaha<br>
<br>
Ranj me apne ziyaada na rulaao bhai<br>
Jald nashaad behan ko bhi bulaao bhai<br>
____________________________<br>
Hogaye aap suwe quld rawaa'n bhai jaa'n<br>
Rehgayi peetne ye soqtaa jaa'n bhai jaa'n<br>
Hai meri aankhou me taareek jahaa'n bhai jaa'n<br>
Paayegi tum ko ye naashaad kaha'n bhaai jaa'n<br>
<br>
Huwi paida mai buzurgou ke liye rone ko<br>
Nahi maloom ke jeeti hu kise rone ko<br>
____________________________<br>
Haq se karne lagi ye arz wo naashaad o hazee'n <br>
Qaaliq e jinno bashar rabbe samawaat o zamee'n <br>
Ek bhaai ke siwa ab koi zainab ka nahi'n<br>
Iski bhi jaan ke dushman hai hazar o be dee'n<br>
<br>
Ab kisi ki na kare qidmat e aaqir zainab<br>
Ab odh'he na kisi laash pe chaadar zainab<br>
____________________________<br>
Ghusl jab de chuke mayyat ko baraadar ki hussain<br>
Rakhhi taboot me kafnaake huwa dil bechain<br>
Le chale ghar janaaza jo ba'ad shewan o shain<br>
Ahlebait e nabawi doudhe ye karte huwe bain<br>
<br>
Hujra e paak e hassan hogaya qaali hai hai<br>
Qabr me sone chale sayyad e aali hai hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Behne chillati hai rokar kaho kab aaoge<br>
Mil ke nana se baradar kaho kab aaoge<br>
Bain zouja ke the sarwar kaho kab aaoge<br>
Ghar me aye sibte payambar kaho kab aaoge<br>
<br>
Ab naa paaungi amaa'n sadma o gham se moula<br>
Chain tha mera faqat aap ke dam se moula<br>
____________________________<br>
Koun lega mere bachou ki qabar aap ke baad<br>
Kis tarha hogi yateemou ki basar aap ke baad<br>
Kya kare jee ke, ye tanqeeda jigar aap ke baad<br>
Qoob hai loundi bhi marjaaye agar aap ke baad<br>
<br>
Jald is gulshan e hasti se guzar jaau mai<br>
Hone paaye na suwam aapka mar jaau mai<br>
____________________________